# Thử API xác thực hiện có theo docs/api-contract.md mục 3, 6.1–6.3.
# Trinh duyet/REST Client tu dong luu va gui cookie lv_refresh giua cac request
# Chỉ dùng tài khoản dev. Các giá trị bên dưới là placeholder; không commit token/mật khẩu thật.

@api = http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth

### 1. Dang ky tai khoan moi (ROLE-01, AUTH-04) -> 202 Accepted (khong body)
POST {{api}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "an@gmail.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "confirmPassword": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van An"
}

### 2. Xac minh email bang token -> 200 OK UserResponse
# Token lấy từ email xác minh gửi tới tài khoản dev; không yêu cầu ghi token vào log.
POST {{api}}/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "thay-token-o-day"
}

### 3. Gui lai link xac minh email -> 202 Accepted (khong body)
POST {{api}}/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "an@gmail.com"
}

### Lấy proof trước login; lấy lại theo principal mới trước refresh/logout
# @name csrf
GET {{api}}/csrf

@csrfToken = {{csrf.response.body.requestToken}}

### 4. Dang nhap -> 200 OK AuthSessionResponse + Set-Cookie lv_refresh
# @name login
POST {{api}}/login
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "an@gmail.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "rememberMe": true
}

### Luu access token tu ket qua dang nhap
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5. Xem phien hien tai (dung Bearer access token) -> 200 OK UserResponse
GET {{api}}/session
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Lấy proof anonymous mới trước refresh (GET và POST đều không gửi Bearer)
# @name refreshCsrf
GET {{api}}/csrf

### 6. Lam moi phien (dung cookie lv_refresh) -> 200 OK AuthSessionResponse + cookie moi
# @name refresh
POST {{api}}/refresh
X-CSRF-Token: {{refreshCsrf.response.body.requestToken}}

### Lấy proof theo Bearer mới trước logout; giữ cùng principal cho POST tiếp theo
# @name logoutCsrf
GET {{api}}/csrf
Authorization: Bearer {{refresh.response.body.accessToken}}

### 7. Dang xuat -> 204 No Content + xoa cookie lv_refresh
POST {{api}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{refresh.response.body.accessToken}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{logoutCsrf.response.body.requestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "revokeAllDevices": false
}

### Lấy proof anonymous mới cho ví dụ lỗi login độc lập
# @name failedLoginCsrf
GET {{api}}/csrf

### 8. Thu dang nhap sai mat khau -> 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS (attemptsRemaining giam dan)
POST {{api}}/login
X-CSRF-Token: {{failedLoginCsrf.response.body.requestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "an@gmail.com",
  "password": "SaiMatKhau123!"
}
